OL,3,GNEWSAMan feeling 'fobbed off' over rat
OL,4,Acomplaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA property owner on a town street
OL,7,Fplagued by rats has said he feels
OL,8,F"fobbed off" after the council failed
OL,9,Fto respond to his complaint about the
OL,10,Frodents on time.
OL,12,FRichard Huysers complained to
OL,13,FDarlington Borough Council on 16
OL,14,FOctober about problems on Westmoreland
OL,15,FStreet where residents say huge rats,
OL,16,Fdead rodents, dog mess and dumped
OL,17,Frubbish have made life a misery.
OL,19,FHe was told a response was due by 4
OL,20,FNovember, but said he was still waiting
OL,21,Falmost a month after making the
OL,22,Fcomplaint.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
